# MARSFORALL // GALE-01 Cursor Rules
# Project: MARSFORALL // GALE-01 (NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026)

- ALWAYS enforce zero gradients in CSS and Tailwind (no bg-gradient-*, linear-gradient, radial-gradient).
- ALWAYS enforce zero emojis in all UI elements, labels, buttons, and alerts.
- NEVER use official NASA logos, meatballs, or worms. Use `/images/marsforall-badge.svg`.
- Enforce 5 operational NASA planetary layers (Optik HiRISE/CTX, Topografi 1m DTM, Termal THEMIS Sand Trap, Sains CRISM/WEH, Keselamatan MGS MAG/RAD).
- Render Curiosity Historical Traverse and Bradbury Landing Ellipse with dashed cyan tactical line styling.
- Ensure all numerical telemetry uses font-mono tabular-nums with explicit SI units.
- Ensure offline-first operation with embedded GeoJSON datasets.
